Key Findings – Research Paper 1 (Xiaoxi Liu, 2021)
The study presents a Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM‑based health cloud platform designed specifically for elderly care.

The platform integrates TCM health concepts with modern digital technologies to support personalised wellness services.

It enhances remote health monitoring, allowing elderly users to track physical conditions and receive timely guidance.

The system improves service accessibility, enabling elderly individuals to obtain health advice without needing in‑person visits.

The platform supports data collection and analysis, helping caregivers and practitioners make more informed decisions.

It demonstrates how combining TCM principles with cloud technology can strengthen preventive healthcare for ageing populations.

The research highlights the potential of digital platforms to improve efficiency, accuracy, and continuity in elderly healthcare services.
